      <article class="card" style="border-top:5px solid var(--leaf)">
        <span class="pill" style="margin-bottom:12px">🌱 Research</span>
        <h3>Trichoderma-enriched FYM cuts wilt losses in chilli — season 1 results</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">A 12-acre block comparison in Kallur mandal showed wilt incidence down from ~18% to under 7% after two seasons of Trichoderma-treated compost. Full protocol published in our next workshop.</p>
        <p class="form-note" style="margin-top:10px">14 October 2026 · 4 min read</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card" style="border-top:5px solid var(--soil)">
        <span class="pill" style="margin-bottom:12px">🆕 New formulation</span>
        <h3>Bio-first paddy programme: neem + Bt rotation protects beneficials</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">New season guidance: start IPM with neem 10000 ppm at tillering, escalate to Cartap GR only above 2 egg masses/m². Spider and mirid populations survived at 3× the conventional-block level.</p>
        <p class="form-note" style="margin-top:10px">2 October 2026 · 5 min read</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card" style="border-top:5px solid var(--amber)">
        <span class="pill" style="margin-bottom:12px">🤝 Collaboration</span>
        <h3>Field-trial MoU signed with a regional agricultural university</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">Two plot-trials per crop season — resistance monitoring for cotton bollworm and residue benchmarking for rabi groundnut. Findings will be published farmer-first, in plain language.</p>
        <p class="form-note" style="margin-top:10px">19 September 2026 · 3 min read</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card" style="border-top:5px solid var(--leaf-mid)">
        <span class="pill" style="margin-bottom:12px">🏆 Success story</span>
        <h3>Cotton that escaped both pink bollworm and whitefly — the Ieeja block</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">Trap-based gating (spray only above ETL) cut 4 sprays to 2 across a 40-acre cluster. Growers saved roughly ₹1,200/acre while matching the neighbour's yield.</p>
        <p class="form-note" style="margin-top:10px">28 August 2026 · 6 min read</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
